<div class="MsoNormal">Thanks for contacting us about importing freight from overseas.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />
&nbsp;<br />
As all shipments into Australia need to be cleared through customs which can be quite a complex process, there are some points to consider when arranging your shipment.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Qantas Freight can help if you want to manage the booking yourself as we offer an airport to airport service only. You'll need to drop off and pick up your goods at the airport freight terminals and manage the customs clearance process. The other option is to consider using a specialist agent.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
<b>Using a specialist agent</b><br />
&nbsp;<br />
Specialist agents manage every aspect of your shipment, offering door to door collection and delivery of your freight and handling the customs clearance process.<br />
Many companies offer this service, so search online, then compare your options and the quotes so you're getting to the right service for your needs and budget.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
<b>Managing the shipment yourself</b><br />
&nbsp;<br />
Clearing and collecting goods can be arranged yourself depending on your goods, but it can be quite complex. In some cases, clearance can be arranged directly with Australian Customs and we recommend you seek further advice from Customs via their <a href="https://www.border.gov.au/Trav/Impo">website</a> or on 1300 558 099.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
To clear the goods yourself, you'll need to:<br />
&nbsp;<br />
- collect the original documents at the final destination from the freight terminal and 100 points of identification will be required before documents can be released<br />
&nbsp;<br />
- be available to clear goods during Australian Customs operating hours, which are generally between 9am and 4pm weekdays<br />
&nbsp;<br />
- return to the freight terminal once customs cleared to pay any outstanding import handling fees which can be paid by EFTPOS<br />
&nbsp;<br />
You'll find more information on <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/help/importing.html">qantasfreight.com</a><br />
&nbsp;<br />
We hope this has helped you with planning your shipment. If you need any further assistance please let us know.<br />
&nbsp;
<p>Kind Regards,<br />
<br clear="none" />
<strong>Customer Service</strong>&nbsp;<br />
